WEBVTT

00:00.150 --> 00:01.250
Living with a star.

00:01.920 --> 00:04.114
Everything alive here runs on that light.

00:04.508 --> 00:10.618
The Sun is about halfway through its life: four and a half billion years old, with some five billion to go.

00:11.145 --> 00:12.350
Never look straight at it.

00:12.778 --> 00:16.293
The safe way to see the Sun is by its light on everything else.
